Z||000000||Philphine||11-01-2000||12:18 PM||||<BR>anybody used them to put, like corvette or camaro wheels on their fiero. i have a set of 18s i'm tempted to try on it, but i may need a little more back space and the bolt pattern's different. i got the wheels used for a different project (right now the hot thing is a big cruiser with big low profiles) and they came with tires that are so low profile that the over all dia. matches a fiero pretty well. i'd just get rid of the tires other wise. <P>i know there are wheel bearing concerns and the cost of replacement tires (yumpin' yiminy) but the look has me thinking about it.<P>------------------<BR>Phil T<P>'87 coupe (feral)<BR>'84 indy<BR>'84 coupe (cheap thrill)||||reg||1
